# Build output.
#
# Root-anchored on purpose. A bare `pulse` here also matches the DIRECTORY
# cmd/pulse, which silently excludes main.go — the repo then has no main package
# and `git status` shows nothing wrong, because ignored files are not reported.
# (The same shape as the bare `server` entry in pulse-backend, which hides
# cmd/server/main.go from recursive grep.)
/dist/
/pulse
/pulse.exe

# Go
*.test
*.out

# Signing material NEVER belongs in the repo. The private key lives in Vault
# (kv/pulse-cli/cosign) and reaches CI as a Woodpecker secret. cosign.pub IS
# committed, on purpose — it is what users verify against.
cosign.key
*.pem
